{"4130150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Ones Beyond", "steam_appid": 4130150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your sister is missing.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You enter the dark forest to find her.</strong><br><strong>Something is watching you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ones Beyond is a first-person psychological horror experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130150/extras/ce3e53f705cd6c6531ddd6d72ca7efe1.poster.avif?t=1787672327\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130150/extras/ce3e53f705cd6c6531ddd6d72ca7efe1.webm?t=1787672327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130150/extras/ce3e53f705cd6c6531ddd6d72ca7efe1.mp4?t=1787672327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As you return to the place where your sister was last seen, you begin to realize the forest is no longer empty. Deep within the woods, a mysterious cult performs disturbing rituals.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>They don’t kill you immediately.</strong><br><strong>Maybe they want to watch your fear grow.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Awaits You in the Demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌲 A dense, atmospheric forest to explore</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔦 Limited light and suffocating darkness</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>👁 Hiding and avoiding detection</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>💀 Unsettling, story-driven horror moments</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No weapons.</strong><br><strong>No power.</strong><br><strong>Only darkness and something that knows exactly where you are.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>👁 A Constant Feeling of Being Watched</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies don’t always attack. The uncertainty builds tension.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌑 True Survival Horror</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You must navigate the darkness and survive with minimal guidance.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>📼 Retro-Inspired Visual Style</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A disturbing lo-fi aesthetic inspired by 90s horror atmosphere.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130150/extras/0c3eebed25ffd7b00186f748fe81c15f.poster.avif?t=1787672327\" width=450 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130150/extras/0c3eebed25ffd7b00186f748fe81c15f.webm?t=1787672327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your sister is missing.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You enter the dark forest to find her.</strong><br><strong>Something is watching you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ones Beyond is a first-person psychological horror experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130150/extras/ce3e53f705cd6c6531ddd6d72ca7efe1.poster.avif?t=1787672327\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130150/extras/ce3e53f705cd6c6531ddd6d72ca7efe1.webm?t=1787672327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130150/extras/ce3e53f705cd6c6531ddd6d72ca7efe1.mp4?t=1787672327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As you return to the place where your sister was last seen, you begin to realize the forest is no longer empty. Deep within the woods, a mysterious cult performs disturbing rituals.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>They don’t kill you immediately.</strong><br><strong>Maybe they want to watch your fear grow.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Awaits You in the Demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌲 A dense, atmospheric forest to explore</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔦 Limited light and suffocating darkness</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>👁 Hiding and avoiding detection</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>💀 Unsettling, story-driven horror moments</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No weapons.</strong><br><strong>No power.</strong><br><strong>Only darkness and something that knows exactly where you are.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>👁 A Constant Feeling of Being Watched</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies don’t always attack. The uncertainty builds tension.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌑 True Survival Horror</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You must navigate the darkness and survive with minimal guidance.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>📼 Retro-Inspired Visual Style</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A disturbing lo-fi aesthetic inspired by 90s horror atmosphere.</strong></p>